# Page-drift regression tests: they parse demo.html/demo-toy.html/ui.html and
# assert the copy still matches the data, so they need a live Flask test client
# and the local guideline store. Nothing imports them, no CI runs them, and the
# paper does not cite them -- they are a local guard against hand-edited HTML
# drifting from regenerated bundles, not part of the reported artefact.
patient_checker/test_demo_consistency.py
patient_checker/test_demo_scenarios.py

# Merged into the root DOCUMENTATION.md; kept on disk only as the merge source.
CQL_converter/DOCUMENTATION.md
patient_checker/DOCUMENTATION.md

CQL_converter/tests/
